Ldap Connect Url Is "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon"

Ldap Connect Url "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" As "Foo-Conn"
Ldap Connect Url "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" As Foo-Conn

Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" User Is "Foo" Password Is "Bar"
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" User Is Foo Password Is Bar
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" User Foo Password Bar

Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "ntlm"
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is NTLM
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "simple" User Is "Foo" Password Is "Bar"
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is SIMPLE User Is "Foo" Password Is "Bar"
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon"
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is ANON

Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Read Only
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Read-Only
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Read Only True
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Read Only Is True
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Read Only Is "okay"
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Read Only Is None

Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Time Limit 300
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Time Limit Is 300
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Time Limit Is "300"
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Time Limit Is None

Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Page Size 100
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Page Size Is 100
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Page Size Is "100"
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Page Size Is None

Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Empty Attrs
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Empty Attributes
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Empty Attributes True
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Empty Attributes Is True
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Return Empty Attributes Is True
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Return Empty Attributes Is "okay"
Ldap Connect To "ldap://foo.com" Auth Is "anon" Return Empty Attributes Is None
